e_item_assets/steam/apps/1299760/extras/9456ae73a9b8e00007bc90e74afa978d.mp4?t=1713984136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>The basic elements of the gameplay are:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>city driving and shootouts, which are tied together with cinematics that tell the story<br></li><li>simple puzzles<br></li><li>searching for lenses<br></li><li>chasing<br></li><li>running away<br></li><li>carrying boxes<br></li><li>conversations and meeting new people</li></ul><br><i><br>Missions are made up of these basic elements, but each has its own color and the player will never be bored.</i><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299760/extras/a495954b4b8ec11fd9bbf5ca10e89781.webp?t=1713984136\" /></div><br>The game is made by two Prague-based developers<br>Tom Barsweik (scripting and the script) &amp; Franz Bayer (graphics) from the SiCzech Arts studio (The Naked Game).<br><br>The games developments started in January 2019.<br><br>Several voice actors and actors are already helping with the game.<br>The main character is played by the Czech slammer Anatol Svahilec,<br>his partner is played by the actor Miki K\u0159en and the supple<br>waitress M\u00edla speaks with the fair voice of the Slovakian singer Marina Laduda.<br><br>To be able to develop the full game, we require an investor or a successful crowdfunding campaign.<br>With the money raised we will be able to hire additional team members and create the game in a reasonable timeframe.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299760/extras/147de49fdd18336b5618a48680ce2387.avif?t=1713984136\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299760/extras/221c83e619c290eb2200ea9ca1b952c9.avif?t=1713984136\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299760/extras/81a3672246474e38dde0182570b96de4.avif?t=1713984136\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299760/extras/89aa10be08dd1a4aae3cd6ac0698e7fc.avif?t=1713984136\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299760/extras/3d090e52d6601dbfde2cc0f86bc60940.avif?t=1713984136\" /></div>",
